sequenceDiagram
    title Account recovery request — illustrative, not a security design
    actor User
    participant UI as Recovery form
    participant API as Recovery endpoint
    participant Service as Recovery service
    User->>UI: Submit address
    UI->>API: Validated request
    API->>Service: Request recovery
    Service-->>API: Neutral result
    API-->>UI: Generic confirmation
    UI-->>User: Show confirmation
